{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>美國總統特朗普支持讓黃仁勳重新擔任英偉達行政總裁的呼聲。周一啓程前往亞洲之前，特朗普在白宮被記者問及黃仁勳是否可能重掌英偉達。「我不會介意，」 他説，「很多人都在問Jensen，他們認為Jensen應該回去。這當然不是個壞主意。」</p>\n<h2>最新資訊</h2>\n<h2>編輯精選</h2>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<h3>熱門評論</h3>\n<h3>相關文章</h3>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<h3>Top 10</h3>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-16T16:00:09.966236+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":142,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-16T15:44:02+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-17T16:51:01.128544+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-16T15:53:39.455248+00:00","content_hash":"6e6a522e91bc852fe28a71af9e2be598f4ce1811a1808bc179142d3911797e3f","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}